<div class="card reveal" style="margin-top:22px">
<h3 style="font-weight:950; font-size:22px;" data-i18n="about.title">
  About Me
</h3>

<div class="car" style="color: #7c8698;font-size: 16.5px;">

  <p data-i18n="about.p1">
    I am a results-driven Software Engineer, Project Manager, and Solution Architect with over 
    <b>12 years of experience</b> delivering enterprise-grade software solutions across complex technical environments. 
    I specialize in bridging business objectives with scalable technology, leading engineering teams, and ensuring reliable delivery from concept to production.
  </p>

  <p data-i18n="about.p2">
    Currently, I work at <b>F.A.S.T. GmbH, Germany</b>, where I lead enterprise software initiatives and manage cross-functional engineering teams 
    to deliver <b>scalable, high-performance systems</b>. My role combines delivery ownership, technical leadership, and architectural decision-making 
    to ensure measurable business outcomes.
  </p>

  <p data-i18n="about.p3">
    Previously, I worked with <b>Larsen &amp; Toubro Infotech (LTI)</b>, contributing to large-scale enterprise solutions for international organizations 
    including <b><u>Netflix, Paramount, Sony, and Viacom</u></b>. I was also involved in enterprise initiatives related to 
    <b>Saint-Gobain (France)</b>, gaining valuable experience within global engineering environments and high-quality delivery standards.
  </p>

  <p data-i18n="about.p4">
    I hold certifications in <b>AWS Solutions Architecture, DevOps, and Project Management (PMP)</b> and I am recognized for solving complex 
    technical challenges while delivering stable, maintainable, and business-aligned solutions.
  </p>

  <p data-i18n="about.p5">
    Throughout my career, I have successfully led projects across the full software lifecycle — from requirements analysis and architecture design 
    to development, deployment, and long-term optimization. I consistently improve <b>performance, scalability, and operational efficiency</b> 
    using modern engineering practices and structured delivery processes.
  </p>

  <p data-i18n="about.p6">
    Beyond technical execution, I bring strong business awareness — identifying cost optimization opportunities, improving service levels, 
    and ensuring projects are delivered <b>on time and within budget</b>. My communication and leadership skills allow me to build trust 
    across teams while maintaining compliance with organizational standards.
  </p>

  <p data-i18n="about.core">
    <b>Core Expertise:</b><br>
    Software Architecture • Project Leadership • Enterprise Systems • Full-Stack Development • Agile Delivery • Technical Strategy • 
    Database Design • System Integration • DevOps Practices • Performance Optimization • Stakeholder Management • Engineering Leadership
  </p>

</div>
